      "writtenOn": "2022-04-14T01:01:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the Le audio book, there is a Cig state machine (no CIG, configurable CIG, active CIG, and inactive CIG). Do we need to add some states and have more alignment with that book?",
      "revId": "25a9ba39a09723f241c5d9c77eae915c2fe9388c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c8f7e2ee_5283979a",
