        "id": 1532219
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-14T09:02:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Non-interim states `IDLE` and `CREATED` confuse me a bit, since they are both idle-like states as there is no pending actions on them. Maybe renaming `IDLE` to `NONE` would be beneficial, since there is actually no CIG in the current `IDLE` state.",
      "revId": "25a9ba39a09723f241c5d9c77eae915c2fe9388c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
