      "writtenOn": "2022-04-14T10:57:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for your suggestion. However, those states are not helpful in our case as it is related to state of the CISes in the CIG. \nWe are looking here only on the moment of creating and removing CIG.",
